## 📦 Asset Import Checklist

### Before Importing Assets

- [ ] All images exported in correct densities (mdpi, hdpi, xhdpi, xxhdpi)
- [ ] PNG files compressed to < 100KB (use TinyPNG)
- [ ] VectorDrawables properly formatted as XML
- [ ] Audio files encoded at correct bit rates (128kbps SFX, 192kbps music)
- [ ] Font files included (Roboto, Inter, optional: Poppins)
- [ ] Color values defined in colors.xml
- [ ] Dimen values defined in dimens.xml
- [ ] All strings localized in strings.xml and values-hi/values-kn

### Gradle Configuration

Add to `build.gradle.kts`:

```kotlin
android {
    compileSdk = 34
    
    defaultConfig {
        applicationId = "com.streettycoon"
        minSdk = 24
        targetSdk = 34
        
        vectorDrawables {
            useSupportLibrary = true
        }
    }
    
    dependencies {
        // Vector drawable support
        implementation("androidx.vectordrawable:vectordrawable:1.1.0")
        
        // Material Design 3
        implementation("androidx.compose.material3:material3:1.0.0")
    }
}
```

