## 🎯 Asset Usage in Kotlin

### Loading Drawables

```kotlin
// Vector Drawable (VectorDrawable)
Image(
    painter = painterResource(id = R.drawable.ic_upgrade),
    contentDescription = "Upgrade button",
    modifier = Modifier.size(24.dp),
    tint = Color.Green
)

// Bitmap Image (PNG)
Image(
    painter = painterResource(id = R.drawable.stall_tea),
    contentDescription = "Tea stall",
    modifier = Modifier.size(256.dp)
)

// Using colors
Box(
    modifier = Modifier
        .size(64.dp)
        .background(
            color = colorResource(id = R.color.primary),
            shape = RoundedCornerShape(8.dp)
        )
)

// Using dimens
Box(
    modifier = Modifier
        .size(dimensionResource(id = R.dimen.tap_button_size))
        .padding(dimensionResource(id = R.dimen.spacing_lg))
)
```

